	(text_box "Strap boot mode (MIO5) to GND for JTAG. This can be done by exposing this pin through debug connector to complete a ground loop only when debugger is plugged in.\n\nIf this is not implemented, can just short pin to GND on-board."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
